<!--
    Ente Saver launcher foreground - "the squeezed photo": the same photo,
    pressed lighter. A white photo card, tilted 5.5 degrees like a print
    picked up, its sides pinched in (each one concave arc, tangent to the
    round corners), with a mountain range and a sun in it. Saver's own badge,
    a two-tone green leaf - the saver - shares the card's outline on its
    top-right corner.
    Ente Photos' sticker style: an even 2.6 dp #1C1C1C outline, a #E8E8E8
    inner crescent, a lighter-green badge with a 2.2 dp outline and one
    highlight dot. Background layer: flat #08C225.
    Layers: one ink silhouette (card outline, leaf outline and the picture as
    a single shape, so no seams), the white paper, the grey crescent, the
    leaf, its darker half, the highlight dot.
-->
